---
import MemberLayout from '../../../layouts/MemberLayout.astro';
---

<MemberLayout title="Women in Golf Charter">
  <div class="policy-page">
    <div class="policy-header">
      <a href="/members/documents" class="back-link">&larr; Back to Documents</a>
      <div class="header-content">
        <div class="charter-badge">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="32" height="32">
            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="header-label">R&amp;A Women in Golf Charter</p>
          <h1>Our Ladies Section</h1>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="charter-content">

      <!-- Intro -->
      <div class="intro-block">
        <p>
          Alnmouth Village Golf Club has a friendly and relaxed ladies' section where the social side of
          golf is as important as the game itself. There is a warm welcome for all regardless of previous
          golfing experience, and we want to encourage more ladies and girls to join us.
        </p>
        <p>
          We have recently signed up to the R&amp;A's Women in Golf Charter and have made a series of
          pledges to help ladies and girls get into golf.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pledges -->
      <div class="pledges-section">
        <h2>Our Pledges</h2>
        <ul class="pledge-list">
          <li>
            <div class="pledge-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" width="18" height="18">
                <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span>Running events to encourage more women and girls to play golf in a safe environment</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="pledge-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" width="18" height="18">
                <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span>Ensuring that we have a good level of female representation on the Alnmouth Village Golf Club Board</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="pledge-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" width="18" height="18">
                <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span>Creating even better community links</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="pledge-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" width="18" height="18">
                <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span>
              Working with <a href="/pro">Linzi Hardy, the club professional</a>, we will develop and
              promote a pathway to helping ladies into golf by making individual and group coaching
              sessions available
            </span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="pledge-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" width="18" height="18">
                <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span>
              Our Ladies section will ensure that any new ladies feel welcomed in our recently
              refurbished clubhouse with coffee and cake sessions to help demystify the rules and
              understand the etiquette on the course
            </span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Quote -->
      <blockquote class="quote-block">
        <p>
          "We are delighted to support the Ladies Section with this drive for new members — any
          initiative that helps more people enjoy golf on our wonderful links course is a bonus for
          Alnmouth Village Golf Club."
        </p>
        <cite>Ian Simpson, Club Secretary</cite>
      </blockquote>

      <!-- R&A Charter -->
      <div class="randa-section">
        <h2>The R&amp;A Women in Golf Charter</h2>
        <p>
          You can read the R&amp;A Women in Golf Charter by visiting the
          <a href="https://www.randa.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">R&amp;A website</a>
          or you can
          <a href="https://www.randa.org/en/key-projects/women-in-golf-charter" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            get it here
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="14" height="14" style="display:inline;vertical-align:middle;margin-left:2px">
              <path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/>
              <polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"/>
              <line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"/>
            </svg>
          </a>.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <style>
    .policy-page {
      max-width: 800px;
    }

    .policy-header {
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .back-link {
      color: var(--primary);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    .back-link:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .header-content {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .charter-badge {
      width: 64px;
      height: 64px;
      background: var(--primary);
      color: var(--white);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .header-label {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      color: var(--primary);
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;
    }

    .policy-header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      color: var(--primary);
    }

    /* Charter content card */
    .charter-content {
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .intro-block {
      padding: 2rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    }

    .intro-block p {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: var(--text-light);
      margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    }

    .intro-block p:last-child {
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* Pledges */
    .pledges-section {
      padding: 2rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    }

    .pledges-section h2 {
      color: var(--primary);
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0;
      padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary);
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .pledge-list {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .pledge-list li {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.875rem;
      align-items: flex-start;
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .pledge-icon {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      background: var(--primary);
      color: var(--white);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 0.1rem;
    }

    .pledge-list a {
      color: var(--primary);
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    /* Quote */
    .quote-block {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 2rem;
      background: var(--surface);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    }

    .quote-block p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
    }

    .quote-block cite {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-style: normal;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--primary);
    }

    /* R&A section */
    .randa-section {
      padding: 2rem;
    }

    .randa-section h2 {
      color: var(--primary);
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
      padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary);
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .randa-section p {
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--text-light);
      margin: 0;
    }

    .randa-section a {
      color: var(--primary);
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .randa-section a:hover {
      color: var(--primary-dark);
    }
  </style>
</MemberLayout>
